	(text "THE SLOT LOGIC: SELCPU, THE WRITE FLIP-FLOP, THE -WE PULSE, THE RAM'S -OE, THE READ LATCH'S CLOCK" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3c16f134-5672-5712-8005-2f42783025b2"))
	(text "SELCPU = D2 OR NOT GFX-ON: with GFX-ON the display has the RAM in dots 0-3 and 8-11, the CPU in 4-7 and 12-15;\nwithout it the CPU has it for good (direct mode). WRQ (IC34/A) takes the window's write strobe as a CPU slot\nbegins; P56 (IC35/A) is high in dots 5-6 and 13-14. -WE = NAND(WRQ, P56) AND NAND(NOT GFX-ON, GWR): a whole\npulse in slot mode, the strobe itself in direct mode. GOE = (WRQ OR NOT GFX-ON) AND SELCPU AND GRDOE.\nRDCK (IC35/B) is high in dots 8 and 0. IC34/B holds TXTONLY low: the graphics parts are fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "731605c1-a06e-52de-9e5f-3bb4261d02f7"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
